`,e.jsxs(t.p,{children:["Unknowns: safe executable-plan grammar, concrete engine primitive semantics, dependency locks, enforcement/cancellation and measured costs. These require a chosen authorized runtime. ",e.jsx(t.a,{href:"https://arxiv.org/abs/2507.19457v2",children:"GEPA v2"})," and ",e.jsx(t.a,{href:"https://arxiv.org/abs/2603.28052v1",children:"Meta-Harness v1"})," report their own experimental findings; the source-path observations above neither reproduce those results nor demonstrate game-production gains. Meta-Harness’s ",e.jsx(t.a,{href:"https://github.com/stanford-iris-lab/meta-harness/blob/8123ccabe2b19fa1123090b2e5f1bacc20963ce8/README.md",children:"README"})," explicitly describes a cleaned-up release, so do not equate its current defaults with the paper’s experimental lock."]}),`
