`,e.jsxs(t.p,{children:["The ",e.jsx(t.a,{href:"/docs/game-ai-notes/#gavel-rule-design-search-and-verdict-boundaries",children:"GAVEL source/paper audit"})," separates Ludii compilation, random-play and UCT samples, archive occupancy, reference-relative novelty and human interest. Selected code and paper protocols differ in fitness aggregation and completion semantics; failure sentinels and requested budgets need explicit interpretation. These board-rule observations do not establish general game-development success or an untouched final-test result."]}),`
