`,e.jsxs(t.p,{children:[e.jsx(t.strong,{children:"Source scope:"})," ",e.jsx(t.a,{href:"https://arxiv.org/html/2610.08621v2",children:"paper v2"}),", with released implementation inspected at ",e.jsx(t.a,{href:"https://github.com/IMBALDY/RecursiveGameCreator/tree/8284caeac655e8c6c08354a759b97b1599d426fd",children:e.jsx(t.code,{children:"8284cae"})}),". No agent, game or evaluator was run. The evolving object is the game project; normal operation does not modify model weights, role prompts or controller code."]}),`
`,e.jsxs(t.p,{children:["The Player reads a source copy, writes ",e.jsx(t.code,{children:"reset(seed, profile)"})," / ",e.jsx(t.code,{children:"act(state)"})," policy code and executes real keyboard/pointer actions without per-action model calls. Policies inherit from the retained game, but new versions receive an adaptation call. Equal seeds therefore do not establish equal player skill. Policy completion is not independently verified victory, and three named profiles do not prove diverse human-like behavior. ",e.jsx(t.a,{href:"https://github.com/IMBALDY/RecursiveGameCreator/blob/8284caeac655e8c6c08354a759b97b1599d426fd/src/game_agent_lite/policy.py#L297-L437",children:"Policy inheritance and authoring"})]}),`
`,e.jsxs(t.p,{children:["Behavioral traces and sampled images feed a separate reviewer. The implementation retains a changed candidate only after valid checks/evidence and two opposite A/B presentation orders both prefer it; disagreement, ties or unavailable evidence preserve the incumbent. Citation/hash checks establish evidence identity, not the truth of the review. Ordinary 2 FPS capture cannot certify brief feedback, frame pacing or input latency. ",e.jsx(t.a,{href:"https://github.com/IMBALDY/RecursiveGameCreator/blob/8284caeac655e8c6c08354a759b97b1599d426fd/src/game_agent_lite/loop.py#L19-L28",children:"Promotion gate"}),", ",e.jsx(t.a,{href:"https://github.com/IMBALDY/RecursiveGameCreator/blob/8284caeac655e8c6c08354a759b97b1599d426fd/docs/player-policy.md#L196-L213",children:"capture boundary"})]}),`
`,e.jsxs(t.p,{children:[e.jsx(t.strong,{children:"Reproduction boundary:"})," the released 45-task GameCraft path can score native Player captures through upstream judging/formulas when scoring is separately requested, separately labelled from official input replay. It records ",e.jsx(t.code,{children:"recording_score"})," with ",e.jsx(t.code,{children:"official_score=null"}),", and indexes each round's candidate, including rejected candidates. The GameASG adapter runs one round and explicitly leaves strict end-to-end success null when using the test-only evaluator. These are available adapter implementations, not receipts reproducing published headline results. ",e.jsx(t.a,{href:"https://github.com/IMBALDY/RecursiveGameCreator/blob/8284caeac655e8c6c08354a759b97b1599d426fd/scripts/run_gamecraft_batch.py#L122-L183",children:"GameCraft preparation"}),", ",e.jsx(t.a,{href:"https://github.com/IMBALDY/RecursiveGameCreator/blob/8284caeac655e8c6c08354a759b97b1599d426fd/scripts/run_gamecraft_batch.py#L290-L378",children:"candidate/score records"}),", ",e.jsx(t.a,{href:"https://github.com/IMBALDY/RecursiveGameCreator/blob/8284caeac655e8c6c08354a759b97b1599d426fd/scripts/run_gameasg_batch.py#L223-L244",children:"GameASG metrics"})]}),`
`,e.jsxs(t.p,{children:["Code is MIT; figures, screenshots and other non-code assets are explicitly excluded unless separately licensed. The inspected repository includes regression-test source and configurations, but ",e.jsx(t.code,{children:"runs/"})," contains only a placeholder rather than complete paper-run outputs. Benchmark repositories, runtime images and judge/model access remain external dependencies. ",e.jsx(t.a,{href:"https://github.com/IMBALDY/RecursiveGameCreator/blob/8284caeac655e8c6c08354a759b97b1599d426fd/README.md#L223-L225",children:"Rights"}),", ",e.jsx(t.a,{href:"https://github.com/IMBALDY/RecursiveGameCreator/blob/8284caeac655e8c6c08354a759b97b1599d426fd/docs/benchmarks.md#L1-L5",children:"benchmark dependencies"})]}),`
